      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm not 100% certain this is a bug given what exactly is going on: The way it determines which hand to track the Holoport cursor from depends on which hand has pressed the trigger last. IE: If your last trigger press was the left hand and you go to Holoport, the beam is from your left hand, but if you then press the right hand trigger WHILE Holoporting, the beam suddenly comes out of the right hand instead.\n\nEither way, it's annoying. If the idea was to make it possible to use either hand then they really should've made it an option, not an always-active feature. I move with my left hand and ONLY want the beam to come from my left hand; there is no reason I would ever want it coming out of my right hand. >:|",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
